  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "結婚講好話（六）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>楊忠憲</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">『帥哥』勇壯親像牛，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">身材kau-tshiâng像大樹，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">文武雙全好模樣，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風度翩翩tsiok溫柔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">美女迷眾kā伊想，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">se̍h街仔路姑娘搶，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">飛天鑽地無法溜，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">搶無少女真鬱卒。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh按怎？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh jiok『帥哥』kuānn皮箱，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">走去in兜tàu piànn厝，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伴in媽媽燒好香。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">祝in爸爸食長壽，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">順suà敬你一杯酒，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想beh做你女朋友，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">結果……</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">『帥哥』真厚面皮，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">硬kā掛手指，留tī厝做牽手。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">新娘暗爽，達到目的做鴛鴦。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你，今生今世無法溜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">——bē-bái--lah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">田園百甲全種稻，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規粒山頭全飼牛，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">事業遍佈五大洲，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">趁錢無限年年收。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">新人歡喜度春秋，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">快樂逍遙真自由。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5JfqmBE_3KsMnLBDDQwg1mkcyHmeMe6cdSDnK2mz59LarraVpiUT25qVMfwb-zY6gpQQbCKc6TUEQ1t1s_C1_kpy5kwt59N4sUDSDZTL-vob-YrS-bTvdpX457nNtKqQbbU9D4KUntnJ8-UpUEFFmz8vTIDGfUkFVwZAVAEWljw3crU55I4SW0VCb95sy/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1363%E6%9C%9F_7.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh5JfqmBE_3KsMnLBDDQwg1mkcyHmeMe6cdSDnK2mz59LarraVpiUT25qVMfwb-zY6gpQQbCKc6TUEQ1t1s_C1_kpy5kwt59N4sUDSDZTL-vob-YrS-bTvdpX457nNtKqQbbU9D4KUntnJ8-UpUEFFmz8vTIDGfUkFVwZA